WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.250
Who really builds a building?

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.350
Not just the crew with the hammers.

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:06.100
It starts with one owner,

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:07.400
one empty plot,

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:09.200
and one big idea.

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:12.500
Most people think design is just pretty drawings.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.600
But every line has a price:

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:15.980
the designer draws it,

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:18.400
and the QS counts its cost.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.300
Then come the hidden gates:

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:21.700
government approvals,

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:24.200
and a tender where contractors compete.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.510
And the lowest price

00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:27.850
is not always the best value.

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:30.280
On site, the contractor builds,

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.900
while the supervision consultant

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:34.050
checks every pour and every bolt

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:35.950
against the approved drawings.

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:37.400
Here is the truth:

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:40.550
a project never succeeds because of one hero.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.500
It succeeds when six parties

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:44.400
keep their promises to each other.

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:45.980
Inspections pass,

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:47.580
the keys change hands,

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:50.350
and an idea becomes a place for people.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:51.900
Which role matters most?

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:53.700
Tell us in the comments.
